  "description": "<strong>🎁 Gift this experience to your loved ones! Click here to check out our gift card.</strong>Gift this experience to your loved ones! Click <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/63081\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a> to check out our gift card.<br>\n&nbsp;\n<h2><strong>Tickets for Neon Naked Life Drawing in London</strong></h2>\n<strong>General Admission:</strong> Includes a life drawing class with all materials provided (<em>plus website fees</em>).<br>\n&nbsp;\n<h2><strong>Highlights</strong></h2>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>A Creative Twist:</strong> Swap traditional charcoals for neon pastels and highlighters in this vibrant, experimental life drawing session.</li>\n\t<li><strong>Live UV-Lit Models:</strong> Draw nude models adorned with glowing UV paints and accessories.</li>\n\t<li><strong>Explore New Techniques:</strong> Try creative approaches such as continuous line drawing and pointillism.</li>\n\t<li><strong>Classes Across London:</strong> Enjoy this unique event in iconic venues across the city.</li>\n</ul>\n&nbsp;\n\n<h2><strong>General Info</strong></h2>\n<strong>Dates &amp; Times:</strong> Choose your preferred session when purchasing.<br>\n<strong>Duration:</strong> 1.5–2 hours.<br>\n<strong>Locations:</strong> Venues vary (select during purchase), including:<br>\n&nbsp;\n<ul>\n\t<li>Toulouse Lautrec, Kennington</li>\n\t<li>The Three Colts, Bethnal Green</li>\n\t<li>Prince of Peckham, Peckham</li>\n\t<li>The Phoenix, Oxford Circus</li>\n\t<li>Trinity Arms, Brixton</li>\n\t<li>The Clapham North, Clapham</li>\n\t<li>The Cat &amp; Mutton, Hackney</li>\n</ul>\nFor the Old Queens Head, Angel, our weekly venue, click <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/114191?srsltid=AfmBOooxmodI3N1HtbHFfIEP9yYTAcKGul7PQjLsc2R_s63ChEZVOE_U\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><em>here</em></a>.<br>\nFor our Model Experience Neon Naked Life Drawing Class, monthly at the Phoenix, Oxford Circus, click <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/269617\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><em>here.</em></a><br>\nFor the Corpse Paint Life Drawing Class at our monthly venue The World's End in Camden, click <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/169963\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><em>here.</em></a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Age Requirement:</strong> 18+ with valid ID.<br>\n&nbsp;\n<h2><strong>Description</strong></h2>\nStep into a neon world at Neon Naked Life Drawing — a one-of-a-kind art experience taking place across London.<br>\n<br>\nThis is not a traditional life drawing class. Using neon materials and UV-lit models, you’ll create glowing, psychedelic artwork in a fun, relaxed environment.<br>\nExperiment with different mark-making techniques, from continuous line drawing to pointillism, and watch your sketches come alive under blacklight. Whether you're a complete beginner or an experienced artist, this session is designed to inspire creativity and playful exploration.<br>\n&nbsp;\n<h3><strong>Why You’ll Love It</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>A fun social activity for friends, dates, team events or solo creatives</li>\n\t<li>Energetic atmosphere with music to set the tone</li>\n\t<li>Suitable for all skill levels</li>\n\t<li>All materials included</li>\n</ul>",
